  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Straight quarter-wave trace rising from the edge of the ground plane, fed across a gap at its base. The simplest Bluetooth / 2.4 GHz IoT antenna: the length L sets the frequency (longer = lower), the ground plane is the other half of the antenna. A matching network (Matching tab) improves the match.")
